<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova inflation quickens to 1.9 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Moldova inflation quickens to 1.9 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldovan consumer prices rose 1.9 percent in January after 0.8 percent in December, the State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN CONSUMER PRICES	Jan '97    Dec '96    Jan '96</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		+1.9	 +0.8	 +3.5</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	 +13.0	+15.1	+25.0</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
